#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:1
#: ac6f58139bc044f9a8d1f60d78234312
msgid "候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT"
msgstr "Clean Candidate Structures Before DFT"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:3
#: 5ed4ec6a63cf4c6dbb6b089cf34e8ba4
msgid ""
"这条流程适合处理 `构建数据集` 生成的大批候选结构。目标不是在本地得到最终训练标签， 而是在 DFT "
"之前删掉明显不值得计算的结构，避免把计算资源花在坏构型和重复构型上。"
msgstr ""
"This workflow is for large candidate pools generated by `Make Dataset`. "
"The goal is not to produce final training labels locally, but to remove "
"structures that are clearly not worth calculating before DFT, avoiding "
"wasted resources on bad or duplicate configurations."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:6
#: 297894ff6fb64ef997693529c2fd0301
msgid "一条稳妥路线是："
msgstr "A robust sequence is:"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:8
#: a7d5b06cdd884d6c86ea0b909f2c43bf
msgid ""
"弛豫好的初始结构\n"
"-> 构建数据集：生成候选结构\n"
"-> NEP 数据集查看：查看和清洗异常结构\n"
"-> FPS 代表性采样或其他采样方法选择代表结构\n"
"-> DFT 标注\n"
"-> GPUMD 训练\n"
msgstr ""
"Relaxed initial structures\n"
"-> Make Dataset: generate candidates\n"
"-> NEP Dataset Display: inspect and clean anomalies\n"
"-> FPS Sampling or another sampling method: select representatives\n"
"-> DFT labeling\n"
"-> GPUMD training\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:17
#: 691e7d31b42645e398b305d612586d6a
msgid "1. 从初始结构开始"
msgstr "Step 1: Start from initial structures"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:19
#: 7736547a5c4848a49cb1900eb72453ee
msgid "先准备一批可信的初始结构。它们通常来自已有训练集、弛豫后的晶体、表面模型、缺陷模型或手工构建的原型。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare a set of starting structures, typically from an existing training"
" set, relaxed crystals, surface or defect models, or manually constructed"
" prototypes."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:21
#: 76133b4f59444fd294cb81477adeaeb1
msgid "在 `构建数据集` 页面，先用顶部 `打开` 导入这些初始结构，再添加生成卡片。"
msgstr ""
"On the `Make Dataset` page, use the top `Open` button to import these "
"initial structures, then add generation cards."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:23
#: 3e4477a935ab4232a75884f1ffc01253
msgid "构建数据集的输入与工作区"
msgstr "Make Dataset input and workspace"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:23
#: 3e4477a935ab4232a75884f1ffc01253
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:28
#: 23e9b2476761495b9f78fae1087519f6
msgid ""
"这一步不要跳过。没有初始结构时，大多数构型生成卡没有明确的处理对象；即使某些生成卡能从零创建结构， "
"也应该单独确认它的输出是否符合你要研究的材料体系。"
msgstr ""
"Do not skip this step. Most configuration cards have no object to process"
" without an input structure. Even when a generator can start from "
"scratch, independently verify that its output represents the material "
"system under study."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:31
#: 1caa4055e8bc493fa26d065f40a0c35b
msgid "2. 生成候选结构，不要急着 DFT"
msgstr "Step 2: Generate candidates before DFT"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:33
#: 9e36f46627014c4b9ea56b201c2ced0a
msgid "`构建数据集` 负责把初始结构扩展成候选池。例如："
msgstr ""
"`Make Dataset` expands initial structures into a candidate pool. For "
"example:"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:35
#: 3a742b26cd464c4abde2eacb0e7cbece
msgid "`晶格应变` / `剪切矩阵应变` / `剪切角应变`：补应变附近结构。"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` / `Shear Matrix Strain` / `Shear Angle Strain`: add "
"structures near strained states."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:36
#: ec4f0c99a3e54858a6c00afdf94b12d9
msgid "`原子扰动` / `振动模式扰动`：补近平衡扰动。"
msgstr "`Atomic Perturb` / `Vib Mode Perturb`: add near-equilibrium perturbations."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:37
#: 6879753aac8e445687499969d2533c2d
msgid "`定向空位` / `全局空位` / `插隙与吸附`：补缺陷环境。"
msgstr ""
"`Targeted Vacancy` / `Global Vacancy` / `Interstitial & Adsorbate`: add "
"defect environments."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:38
#: 2bd3e34edac74a909ab85af5eedb49b1
msgid "`表面薄层扫描` / `层错路径`：补表面和层错。"
msgstr "`Surface Slab Scan` / `GSFE Path`: add surfaces and stacking faults."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:39
#: c7d76d5d21174168a71d32382b742862
msgid "`随机掺杂` / `随机占位`：补合金或占位变化。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Doping` / `Random Occupancy`: vary alloy composition or site "
"occupation."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:41
#: 1ba06c2e46e44b169eb050ec871ff2bc
msgid ""
"这些操作会扩大覆盖，但也会引入坏结构。比如扰动过大导致原子距离过近，随机占位产生极端局部环境， "
"表面或缺陷生成后出现不合理配位。候选结构应该先导出为一个中间文件，例如 `candidate_pool.xyz`，再进入下一步清洗。"
msgstr ""
"These operations improve coverage but can also create invalid structures:"
" excessive perturbations may place atoms too close, random occupation may"
" create extreme local environments, and surfaces or defects may have "
"unreasonable coordination. Export the candidates to an intermediate file "
"such as `candidate_pool.xyz` before cleaning them."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:45
#: 27a30e271a274029b66e8a89051b1b08
msgid "3. 在「NEP 数据集查看」里先看结构"
msgstr "Step 3: Inspect structures in NEP Dataset Display"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:47
#: ebd2e9bb1cef4454a6bb1fa27a568cb0
msgid "把 `candidate_pool.xyz` 导入 `NEP 数据集查看`。这一步先做肉眼和几何层面的检查："
msgstr ""
"Import `candidate_pool.xyz` into `NEP Dataset Display` and begin with "
"visual and geometric checks:"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:49
#: 31d017d983ec43a499948f18a7f95cb1
msgid "结构是否明显破碎或重叠。"
msgstr "Look for visibly fragmented or overlapping structures."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:50
#: fd6e62ce43924aaa874383ed534c6eb1
msgid "元素组成是否符合预期。"
msgstr "Confirm that elemental compositions are expected."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:51
#: ea6f163ef4ec42e3b5fabbcc8ca89a3a
msgid "`Config_type` 是否能追溯到生成来源。"
msgstr "Confirm that `Config_type` identifies the generation source."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:52
#: 821627531e014746ad71748efdfb97b0
msgid "是否存在明显过短键长或非物理局部环境。"
msgstr ""
"Look for clearly short interatomic distances or nonphysical local "
"environments."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:54
#: 466c534ec1c640c0bb4f1cda33324ae1
#
msgid "在 NEP 数据集查看中检查候选结构"
msgstr "Inspecting candidates in NEP Dataset Display"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:54
#: 466c534ec1c640c0bb4f1cda33324ae1
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:59
#: f91617f9d3a1432dac5609defa025fb5
msgid "建议先用这些工具："
msgstr "Start with these tools:"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:61
#: 94c7db90c63045dcaa849ad14f8e4829
msgid "`查找非物理结构`：按近邻距离快速找疑似坏构型。"
msgstr ""
"`Find non-physical structures`: quickly flag suspicious configurations by"
" nearest-neighbor distance."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:62
#: e974b615e8d94a8f85cbb6d16546fda9
msgid "`按范围选择`：按范围选择异常点。"
msgstr "`Select by Range`: select outliers in a plotted range."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:63
#: 28cd7e436fa34eac838131bada6bcab7
msgid "`查找最大误差点`：在有参考或预测结果时定位最极端样本。"
msgstr ""
"`Find Max Error Point`: locate the most extreme samples when reference or"
" prediction results are available."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:64
#: 5cac6f68a475407dac8f7d72982e9028
msgid "搜索框：按 `Config_type`、元素或表达式筛某一类结构。"
msgstr ""
"Search box: isolate a structure family by `Config_type`, element, or "
"expression."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:65
#: 9584893eebfc4eb7b9c1e76c1f389063
msgid "`删除选中项` / `撤销删除`：删除和撤销。"
msgstr ""
"`Delete selected items` / `Undo delete`: remove structures or restore the"
" last deletion."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:67
#: 6f14f3c075d24593bc58c9ee0a8084fb
msgid "4. 用 NEP 预测做快速预筛"
msgstr "Step 4: Prescreen with NEP predictions"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:69
#: 508a27dcc0c048cfa20ae6f809bf3eeb
msgid ""
"如果你有可用的预筛模型，可以让 `NEP 数据集查看` 给候选结构做快速预测。 这里的预测值不是 DFT "
"标签，也不能当作训练真值；它只用于发现明显离谱的候选样本。"
msgstr ""
"If a suitable prescreening model is available, use `NEP Dataset Display` "
"to predict the candidate pool. These predictions are neither DFT labels "
"nor training ground truth. They serve only to reveal clearly implausible "
"candidates."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:72
#: 43c9283eeaf54624a97638b7b24ce615
msgid "常见判断包括："
msgstr "Useful warning signs include:"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:74
#: 913c9089cc0e4566ad82b56566be42b7
msgid "某些结构预测力远高于同批样本，大概率有过近原子或极端局部环境。"
msgstr ""
"A structure with predicted forces far above the rest of the batch likely "
"contains atoms that are too close or another extreme local environment."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:75
#: d801a6de89b9427fbffbd3bb0d6828a1
msgid "能量分布出现孤立长尾，需要回到结构视图确认。"
msgstr ""
"An isolated long tail in the energy distribution should be inspected in "
"the structure view."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:76
#: cc1a280a60674d5caae2752e08a24b19
msgid "某一类 `Config_type` 系统性异常，说明上游卡片参数可能过激。"
msgstr ""
"A systematic anomaly within one `Config_type` may indicate overly "
"aggressive parameters in the upstream card."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:78
#: 9695fe89b9664b1993d5315dd9ae0af9
msgid "如果没有可信预筛模型，也不要强行依赖预测值。先做几何检查和人工抽查，再保守地缩小生成参数。"
msgstr ""
"Without a trustworthy prescreening model, do not force a decision from "
"predictions. Use geometric checks and manual spot checks, then "
"conservatively narrow the generation parameters."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:80
#: fb0f807d73dc41789145c31cc39461e1
msgid "5. 先清洗，再 FPS"
msgstr "Step 5: Clean before applying FPS"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:82
#: ae3f02e3626c42b9b10abdb8c2e41ec6
msgid "`FPS 代表性采样` 的作用是从候选池里选代表结构，不是判断结构是否物理合理。"
msgstr ""
"`FPS Sampling` selects representative structures from a candidate pool; "
"it does not judge physical plausibility."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:84
#: 889fa50cb5574560aaabaee4ce86ad70
msgid ""
"如果候选池里混入很多坏结构，直接 FPS 会有一个风险：坏结构在描述符空间里往往很“远”， 因此可能被优先选中。结果看起来覆盖更广，实际却把 "
"DFT 预算花在不该算的结构上。"
msgstr ""
"Applying FPS directly to a contaminated pool is risky. Invalid structures"
" are often far from normal samples in descriptor space and may therefore "
"be selected first. The result appears diverse while spending the DFT "
"budget on structures that should have been rejected."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:87
#: 1f7a6ef32b7946ec8d51ac7e7add007d
msgid "更稳的顺序是："
msgstr "Use this order instead:"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:89
#: fc9e034c6a5d428d9e268a486d3e3070
msgid ""
"候选池\n"
"-> 删除明显坏结构\n"
"-> 删除或隔离预测力极大的结构\n"
"-> 检查每类 Config_type 是否还保留足够样本\n"
"-> 再用 FPS 代表性采样卡片做代表性采样\n"
msgstr ""
"Candidate pool\n"
"-> Remove clearly invalid structures\n"
"-> Remove or quarantine structures with extreme predicted forces\n"
"-> Confirm that every `Config_type` still has enough samples\n"
"-> Apply the FPS Sampling card for representative sampling\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:97
#: 1b1c8d9b477741b7a729ecd5d17ba435
msgid ""
"清洗后的输出可以命名为 `candidate_pool_clean.xyz`。如果之后做 FPS，输出可以命名为 "
"`candidate_pool_fps.xyz`，这样每一步都能追溯。"
msgstr ""
"Name the cleaned output `candidate_pool_clean.xyz` and a subsequent FPS "
"result `candidate_pool_fps.xyz` so every stage remains traceable."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:100
#: b210bd3d4aa544dcbc88b5d6599b1b8d
msgid "6. 送去 DFT 后再回看"
msgstr "Step 6: Review again after DFT"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:102
#: f3f4ee915fc74d0b89fd4c1490baff63
msgid "DFT 标注完成后，把带有能量、力、应力的结构再导入 `NEP 数据集查看`。 这时检查重点会变化："
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling, import the structures with energies, forces, and "
"stresses back into `NEP Dataset Display`. The review now shifts to:"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:105
#: c7057d8094554ad6943931ac4a81af67
msgid "是否有 DFT 未收敛或异常标签。"
msgstr "Unconverged DFT calculations or anomalous labels."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:106
#: 91cce0f9bb1c4f12835bc81fc227088b
msgid "力和能量分布是否出现不合理长尾。"
msgstr "Unreasonable long tails in force or energy distributions."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:107
#: f346a2b223bd45368395d766ea21e06d
msgid "某些构型族是否过多或过少。"
msgstr "Overrepresented or underrepresented configuration families."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:108
#: 5a75917acf464a74850e858a8843f2a0
msgid "训练后模型在哪些结构上误差最大。"
msgstr "The structures on which the trained model has its largest errors."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:110
#: c583661bfd354c3185c7b9086aa8b923
msgid "这一步的输出会决定下一轮 `构建数据集` 应该补什么：是补某类缺陷、某个应变范围， 还是缩小某张生成卡的参数范围。"
msgstr ""
"The output of this step determines what the next `Make Dataset` iteration"
" should add: a defect class, a strain range, or a narrower parameter "
"range for a generation card."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:113
#: 5018454e52924b89b75abfbcc0037d20
msgid "常见误区"
msgstr "Common mistakes"

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:115
#: 4fff700e219a490199dc7b23493fae16
msgid "**误区 1：生成后直接 DFT。** 候选结构不是最终训练集。先清洗通常比事后处理失败 DFT 更省时间。"
msgstr ""
"**Mistake 1: Run DFT immediately after generation.** Candidates are not a"
" finished training set. Cleaning first usually costs less than diagnosing"
" failed DFT calculations later."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:118
#: dc4371cd45664cffb3f203c58d3ed050
msgid "**误区 2：先 FPS 再清洗。** FPS 不知道物理合理性，只知道描述符距离。坏结构可能因为“特别不一样”被选中。"
msgstr ""
"**Mistake 2: Apply FPS before cleaning.** FPS measures descriptor "
"distance, not physical plausibility. An invalid structure may be selected"
" precisely because it is unusually different."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:121
#: 496bb35a7d0c42ab808b7a8cca0ed81f
msgid "**误区 3：把 NEP 预测当作 DFT 标签。** NEP 预测只适合预筛和排序，最终训练标签仍然来自 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"**Mistake 3: Treat NEP predictions as DFT labels.** NEP predictions are "
"suitable for prescreening and ranking; final training labels still come "
"from DFT."

#: ../../source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:124
#: 7f3a45b202b34a02968adf617662efb8
msgid "**误区 4：只看总数量。** 候选池有 5000 个结构不等于覆盖好。更重要的是每类 `Config_type` 的质量和多样性。"
msgstr ""
"**Mistake 4: Judge only by total count.** A pool of 5,000 structures does"
" not guarantee useful coverage. The quality and diversity within each "
"`Config_type` matter more."

